  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
<!-- LB-3D-HERO -->
<canvas id="heroCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
<img class="hero-photo" src="images/hero-work.jpg" alt="Freshly poured concrete driveway with saw-cut joints and caution tape on a residential pour" width="1080" height="925" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
  <div class="hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Maitland NSW &middot; Concreting &amp; excavation</p>
    <h1 data-ux="words">Concrete, poured and finished <em>properly.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Driveways, alfresco areas and outdoor concrete — servicing the Hunter Valley, Newcastle, Central Coast and Port Stephens.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#quote">Get a quote</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#services">What we do</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-strip">
      <p><strong>Driveways</strong>poured &middot; finished &middot; built to last</p>
      <p><strong>Alfresco &amp; outdoor</strong>concrete areas</p>
      <p><strong>Hunter Valley</strong>Newcastle &middot; Central Coast &middot; Port Stephens</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
<section class="svc-band" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">What we do</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Concrete work for the outside of your place.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">From the driveway out front to the alfresco out back — poured, finished and built to handle the Hunter's weather.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="slabs">
      <article class="slab drop">
        <p class="slab-n">01</p>
        <h3>Driveways</h3>
        <p>New concrete driveways poured and finished properly — the surface that carries everything from day one.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="slab drop">
        <p class="slab-n">02</p>
        <h3>Alfresco areas</h3>
        <p>Concrete slabs for alfresco and undercover outdoor living — level, durable and ready for how you'll use it.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="slab drop">
        <p class="slab-n">03</p>
        <h3>Outdoor concrete</h3>
        <p>Paths, pads, shed slabs and general outdoor concrete work around the home or business.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="slab drop">
        <p class="slab-n">04</p>
        <h3>Excavation</h3>
        <p>Site prep and excavation to get the ground ready before anything gets poured.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="slab drop">
        <p class="slab-n">05</p>
        <h3>Residential &amp; commercial</h3>
        <p>Work for homes and business premises — same crew, same standard, whatever the size.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="slab drop">
        <p class="slab-n">06</p>
        <h3>Free quotes</h3>
        <p>Tell us the job and get a straight-up quote — no pressure, no surprises when work starts.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="marq-band" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marq">
    <span>Driveways</span><span>Alfresco</span><span>Outdoor concrete</span><span>Excavation</span><span>Maitland</span><span>Hunter Valley</span>
    <span>Driveways</span><span>Alfresco</span><span>Outdoor concrete</span><span>Excavation</span><span>Maitland</span><span>Hunter Valley</span>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="steps-band" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">How we work</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">From first look to finished slab.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rail">
